{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709290/extras/Strip2.png?t=1747132216\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>A comfortable place to live...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>My Heaven's Dale offers a cozy experience within the farm simulator genre, with every detail lovingly designed to keep you free from stress!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>In this demo version you will find:</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first chapter of the story in brief.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introduction to the main characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introduction to the basic animals on the Ranch and their care.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introduction to the planting systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introduction to the 2 floors of the caves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introduction to the fishing system (bait is limited)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introduction to the stove and refrigerator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A festival available on day 4.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Hours of content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craftable items such as a hose, coffee machine, seed machine, and toilet are available.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Friendship, romance, pet purchase, and moonscape systems will only be present in the final game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709290/extras/steampg.jpg?t=1747132216\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709290?t=1747132216","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709